  <h2>5. Manual Testing Scenarios Quick Start</h2>

  <h3>Scenario A: Student Ordering & Pre-Order Timing</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Log in as Student (<span class="code">alex@student.edu</span> / <span class="code">studentpassword123</span>).</li>
    <li>Select campus (e.g. <strong>NIT Delhi</strong>).</li>
    <li>Click a canteen card (e.g. <strong>Central Student Food Court</strong>).</li>
    <li>Click <span class="code">+ Add to Cart</span> on food items.</li>
    <li>Open Cart Drawer:
      <ul>
        <li>Choose Order Preference: <strong>Dine-In</strong> or <strong>Takeaway / Pack</strong>.</li>
        <li>Choose Preparation Timing: <strong>ASAP</strong>, <strong>+15m</strong>, <strong>+30m</strong>, <strong>+45m</strong>, or <strong>+60m</strong>.</li>
        <li>Choose Payment Method: <strong>Cash on Pickup</strong> or <strong>Razorpay Online</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Click <strong>Place Order</strong> and note down generated Token Number.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Scenario B: Staff Queue & Counter Order Fulfilling</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Log in as Canteen Staff (<span class="code">staff.central@canteen.edu</span> / <span class="code">staff123</span>).</li>
    <li>View live order card: verify <strong>TAKEAWAY</strong> or <strong>DINE-IN</strong> badge and pickup timestamp.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Accept Order</strong> &rarr; <strong>Start Preparing</strong> &rarr; <strong>Mark Ready for Pickup</strong> &rarr; <strong>Deliver / Hand Over</strong>.</li>
    <li>Switch to <strong>Menu Management</strong> tab: click <strong>Available</strong> / <strong>Sold Out</strong> to test stock toggles.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Scenario C: Canteen Owner Sales & Revenue Analytics</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Log in as Canteen Owner (<span class="code">owner.central@canteen.edu</span> / <span class="code">owner123</span>).</li>
    <li>View KPI Metric Cards: Total Revenue, Cash vs Razorpay subtotals, Total Orders, AOV, Order Type Ratio.</li>
    <li>Switch report tabs: <strong>Day-Wise</strong>, <strong>Month-Wise</strong>, <strong>Today's Peak Hours</strong>.</li>
    <li>Inspect <strong>Top 5 Selling Dishes</strong> table and recent order logs.</li>
  </ol>

